  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "Macauley Point Circulation studies (Victoria, B.C.), 1991-1999",
  "description": "Current properties and water properties in the area of Macauley Pt, near Victoria, B.C. in support of constructing models of sewage outfall at Macaulay Pt.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: Constructing models of circulation off Victoria, particularly to predict sewage outfall.\n\nSupplemental information: Risk Justification: Data are in electronic format, well backed up and well documented. Risk of Loss: Low Impact Justification: Does not affect a wide variety of users. Impact of Loss: Low Recommended Action: None",
